    "body": "This PR adds a test to check that the ctx-provided SHA256 compression override takes effect for the following `silentpayments` module API functions:\r\n* `secp256k1_silentpayments_label_create` (hash result is used for calculating the [label tweak](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/blob/46db787112beabdb5e17e0dc35680716f1057e7b/src/modules/silentpayments/main_impl.h#L407-L412))\r\n* `secp256k1_silentpayments_sender_create_outputs` (hash results are used for calculating the [input hash](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/blob/46db787112beabdb5e17e0dc35680716f1057e7b/src/modules/silentpayments/main_impl.h#L72-L76) and [output tweak](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/blob/46db787112beabdb5e17e0dc35680716f1057e7b/src/modules/silentpayments/main_impl.h#L125-L135))\r\n* `secp256k1_silentpayments_recipient_prevouts_summary_create` (hash result is used for calculating the [input hash](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/blob/46db787112beabdb5e17e0dc35680716f1057e7b/src/modules/silentpayments/main_impl.h#L72-L76))\r\n* `secp256k1_silentpayments_recipient_scan_outputs` (hash result is used for calculating the [output tweak](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/blob/46db787112beabdb5e17e0dc35680716f1057e7b/src/modules/silentpayments/main_impl.h#L125-L135))\r\n\r\nWith #1866 for musig and this PR, all public functions that take use of the SHA256 compression override should be covered by tests.",
